      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1949 comedy film, *Strike it Rich*, was shot on location in Lindale, giving the town a brief moment in Hollywood history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
